# Google Calendar + Tasks (Settings / Calendar / Tasks → Connect)
# Create a Web application OAuth client:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# Enable "Google Calendar API" and "Google Tasks API"
# OAuth scopes requested:
#   https://www.googleapis.com/auth/calendar.events
#   https://www.googleapis.com/auth/tasks
#
# Browser connect (GIS popup) — Client ID only (recommended for local):
#   Authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:3000
# Calendar: Summit ↔ Google events on the month grid
# Tasks: Summit Tasks tool ↔ Google Tasks (@default list)
# If you connected before Tasks existed, use Reconnect to re-consent.
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com
#
# Optional server OAuth code flow (needs secret + redirect URI):
#   Redirect URI: http://localhost:3000/api/google/calendar/callback
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-client-secret

# Google Solar API — auto roof measure (Measurements → Auto-measure)
# Enable "Solar API" in Cloud Console, then:
# GOOGLE_SOLAR_API_KEY=your-solar-api-key
# (or reuse GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY if Solar is enabled on that key)

# Supabase (Project Settings → API)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://xxxx.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key
